#brave-browser
"brave-browser (a safer, faster, and better Web browsing experience)"
"Brave is a free and open-source web browser developed by Brave"
"Software, Inc. based on the Chromium web browser."
""
"https://brave-browser.com"

The SLKBUILD repackage the binary for slackware

To build the package type

git clone https://github.com/djemos/brave-browser
cd brave-browser
sudo slkbuild -X
install it with
sudo spkg brave-browser-1.96.61-x86_64-1dj.txz

